[{"title":"秋兴 其二","author":"左锡璇","text":"京洛年年起客愁，韶光荏苒已如流。\n寒生修竹衣裳冷，风入疏棂枕簟幽。\n鲁酒倾尊难洗恨，齐纨藏箧倍惊秋。\n夜来拂拭龙泉剑，剩有寒光谢斗牛。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27875,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"南归留别姊弟","author":"左锡璇","text":"列飙逗高梧，浮云夜暗徂。\n念此涉远道，风波良可虞。\n持尊不能饮，揽辔出清都。\n相顾各无语，握手重踟蹰。\n徘徊歧路侧，横涕沾罗襦。\n别晷一何促，愁思郁难舒。\n悲风振林木，零雨散秋芜。\n昨夜霜华重，红叶满征途。\n从兹一分手，何日复牵裾。\n努力各自勉，善保千金躯。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27876,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"晓发","author":"左锡璇","text":"曙色晓迷漫，惊魂压绣鞍。\n梦摇钗影小，枕贴粉香残。\n黄叶秋林瘦，西风翠袂单。\n离亲日以远，别泪几时乾。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27877,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"安陵野望漫成","author":"左锡璇","text":"古台摇落树苍凉，水碓无云独雁翔。\n乱草西风埋断冢，荒芜秋色冷斜阳。\n云随樵子归何处，山共诗人瘦不妨。\n欲识凄凄离别意，江流宛转似回肠。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27878,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"酬外子凤阳道中寄书","author":"左锡璇","text":"榆高垂恶阴，竹劲秉坚质。\n生物各有涯，盈虚莫可必。\n省书感君意，临饭不能食。\n道远苦风多，胡为独行役。\n网罗满天地，群动何时息。\n悲来如循环，音尘渺相隔。\n焉得从长风，慰君肠似结。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27879,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"晚眺","author":"左锡璇","text":"香气袭窗纱，藤床日影斜。\n谁家新燕子，衔出隔墙花。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27880,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夜行","author":"左锡璇","text":"溪暗闻流泉，月黑不知路。\n时闻出涧中，幽禽学人语。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27881,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春日偶兴","author":"左锡璇","text":"晴曦红到曲廊西，画里天然景不齐。\n夜雨小桃翻锦浪，春风百草绣香泥。\n窗虚尽纳修篁影，林静时闻好鸟啼。\n酒病诗魔消未得，芳情半在绿杨堤。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27882,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"小云妹见示寄怀诗即步原韵 其一","author":"左锡璇","text":"静夜悄难寐，吟行月渐阴。\n疏星下残柳，飞露湿空砧。\n酒酿相思泪，镫摇怨别心。\n冰弦不复理，恐作断肠音。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27883,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"小云妹见示寄怀诗即步原韵 其二","author":"左锡璇","text":"芳草碧千里，浮云路几重。\n寒生残雪夜，月落暮天钟。\n香篆随风散，家书泼墨浓。\n相思两相忆，别梦绕回峰。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27884,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"艳歌 其一","author":"左锡嘉","text":"袖舞云千片，镫摇酒一卮。\n花应怜独影，梦亦解相思。\n屈戌深藏处，阑干小立时。\n幽情无可诉，瘦骨有衾知。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27885,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"艳歌 其二","author":"左锡嘉","text":"院静夜逾静，月圆人未圆。\n红兰娇挹露，碧筱淡淡烟。\n妆罢收明镜，词成调素弦。\n玉阶长寂寂，苔色自娟娟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27886,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋夜曲","author":"左锡嘉","text":"井梧飒飒堕寒翠，海棠蘸露红香醉。\n铃柝无声河汉低，斜月一篱双鹤睡。\n小窗烛短愁夜长，锦衾瑶瑟生微凉。\n欲眠不眠坐申旦，十二云屏思断肠。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27887,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"长昼","author":"左锡嘉","text":"春风扣竹飞晴翠，藕塘波蘸红香醉。\n曲廊斜度竹桥西，紫藤花下狸奴睡。\n一枰棋局消长昼，閒倚琴床数莲漏。\n焚香坐久晚窗深，月子玲珑花影瘦。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27888,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"水窗即景","author":"左锡嘉","text":"拥被独沈吟，红烛结香篆。\n更鼓隔岸挝，斗柄西北转。\n停桡倚石根，波平白沙软。\n群山枕流卧，野寺孤云伴。\n水深鸥梦寒，风急雁行断。\n反侧不成眠，遥夜意缱绻。\n欸乃闻邻舟，清霜布帆卷。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27889,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋夜","author":"左锡嘉","text":"露重湿烟凝，西风户独扃。\n乱蛩鸣振鸣，饥鼠出窥镫。\n梦冷愁如织，骨支寒有棱。\n破窗还夜色，缺月挂孤藤。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27890,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春望","author":"左锡嘉","text":"杨柳风多作意吹，古藤野葛绿垂垂。\n一竿春水溪童钓，半突寒烟病妇炊。\n竹抱虚心留劲节，花含幽思敛啼眉。\n衫轻骨瘦凭危石，自写牢愁勒断碑。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27891,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"访赵悟莲晚归 其一","author":"左锡嘉","text":"数里出城郭，悠然远市嚣。\n寺閒风卷磬，泉激月生潮。\n密竹隐茅舍，疏花带野桥。\n曲堤郁芳若，归路不知遥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27892,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"访赵悟莲晚归 其二","author":"左锡嘉","text":"襟怀恒落落，身世等劳劳。\n惜与故人别，归来山月高。\n清溪鸣水碓，虚壑响松涛。\n镫影透墙隙，书声散郁陶。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27893,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"枯树叹","author":"左锡嘉","text":"黄沙茫茫若华匿，枯树无皮当道立。\n拿云捉月奋爪牙，四起悲风鬼神泣。\n饱经霜雪不记年，夕阳古堠同巍然。\n浓阴密叶曾荫暍，意以屈曲全其天。\n君不见，丁戊之间旱为虐，两年不雨日熏灼。\n析骸易子嗟此邦，岂惜树身遭剥落。\n我行抚树兴长嗟，蜕馀苍骨寒杈丫。\n为问河东千里道，凶年饥馑馀几家。\n颓垣败壁隐蓬户，呜呜仿佛闻人语。\n佝偻老翁兀向前，欲诉未申泪如雨。\n自言身本故家子，颇有田园傍汾水。\n火云炽野草木枯，邻里亲丁皆饿死。\n昔年豪兴游江湖，归葬骨肉还故都。\n所亲无存家为墟，孑然一身何所图。\n愁容惨淡兼衰病，枯树剥肤感同命。\n少时裘葛老无衣，羞向人前道名姓。\n哀弦未终天欲暮，行色匆匆戒前路。\n长揖老翁申慰辞，人力难回信有数。\n前村野店悬孤镫，当为老翁枯树留长句。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27894,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"过龙泉关","author":"左锡嘉","text":"壁镫荧荧天未曙，仆夫促驾出村树。\n乱峰攒攒青接天，悬流千寻飞瀑布。\n石梯险滑级不分，健马力争下蹄处。\n长歌行路关山难，蚁缘九曲云崖间。\n星精摇摇仰可攀，积雪耀日秋风寒。\n马蹄碎兮人力竭，一关横界长天碧。\n我思开山烦五丁，凿穿石穴通青冥。\n又欲移山效愚公，眼前障碍一扫空。\n吁嗟乎！\n所欲安可得，不若卸肩且休息。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27895,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"喜晴 其一","author":"左锡嘉","text":"庭坳深积水，寮绮耀晨晞。\n花亸纚红影，云空露翠微。\n懒鸠朝拂羽，倦蝶晚烘衣。\n天意怜禾稼，阳光满甸圻。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27896,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"喜晴 其二","author":"左锡嘉","text":"久雨苦湿涝，朱阳豁众心。\n菰蒲分水界，苔藓上墙阴。\n蟢子补残网，蜩螗发朗吟。\n开轩当远岫，幽思惬鸣琴。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27897,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寒夜得萧月楼与乌拉扎桐云两夫人书感赋小诗藉以作答","author":"左锡嘉","text":"北风撼窗纸，寒向味寒寂。\n离绪纷如芒，兀坐但守默。\n青鸟不辞远，翩跹落云翮。\n故人情意长，迢递寄胸臆。\n申函蜡炬红，墨花浮黛色。\n上言久别离，下言长相忆。\n知交感参商，良晤安可得。\n念子夫婿贵，古干皎松柏。\n念子太瘦生，辛劳职内则。\n两贤不我遗，同心悦芳泽。\n因知悱恻怀，名族等阀阅。\n岂不云路翔，官高各异域。\n人生怀至性，离悃料难释。\n愿子时加餐，珍重卫朝夕。\n和霭生春风，景福自天锡。\n嗟我就薄养，对案每忘食。\n朔方多风沙，传舍复逼侧。\n平生有姊弟，宦辙异南北。\n儿女虽成行，出门云水隔。\n天涯念骨肉，音书常梗涩。\n绵渺难忘情，望远心常惕。\n况复秋霜零，芙蓉萎芳节。\n触目怀感伤，忍泪不成滴。\n将老遘兹痌，日促鬓丝白。\n何以报知己，仪一心如结。\n夜深砚冰凝，过雁送风急。\n纸短难具陈，月落晓天碧。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27898,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋晓","author":"范淑","text":"残叶忽然尽，西风夜入关。\n云无来去意，秋在渺冥间。\n雨后村烟湿，林疏鸟语閒。\n凭高如有悟，久立尚迟还。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27899,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"林下","author":"范淑","text":"竟日碧云下，默坐已无暑。\n凉风自何来，绿竹动清渚。\n好鸟歇幽林，梳翎复自语。\n不知下有人，此心静如许。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27900,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夏日西斋看雨","author":"范淑","text":"突作奇声不可测，长风欲使孤松折。\n林叶不待西风飞，顿觉南风有秋色。\n怒雨忽山外来，跳波击瓦心怀开。\n雷驱电助不可息，风声盘走如相催。\n暑馀晴雨失调剂，黄尘得雨吹腥气。\n竹中新构读书堂，一缕炎风摇不至。\n书窗掩卷静无声，电卷雷收雨渐停。\n推窗一望净如洗，天光凝碧青山青。\n茅檐低接锄花圃，山园风味清如许。\n数声啼鸟出新晴，半树斜阳滴残雨。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27901,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"望夜见月","author":"范淑","text":"亘古留清气，虚空一鉴磨。\n晚花凉照影，秋水静无波。\n不识圆时好，谁怜缺处多。\n閒云如解得，莫向月前过。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27902,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋日","author":"范淑","text":"吹风吹雨到秋庭，回合秋声入杳冥。\n去日艰辛如梦梦，近来心绪亦惺惺。\n松思护鹤枝常绿，蕉惯听秋叶尚青。\n此境十年亲领略，不须感叹说凋零。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27903,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"绝句","author":"范淑","text":"我慕水中莲，慕其心独苦。\n清泉知汝深，相照各无语。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27904,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"落梅","author":"范淑","text":"率意来空圃，无心见落梅。\n依依自相惜，恋恋欲空回。\n花落枝仍古，篱荒气不衰。\n眼看桃欲放，为汝一徘徊。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27905,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"问园杂诗 其一","author":"范淑","text":"高花短树绿萝墙，十载閒居插种忙。\n偶爱数竿青竹好，三年迸笋渐成行。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27906,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"问园杂诗 其二","author":"范淑","text":"绿阴铺径茁新芽，堕地春桃雨后加。\n记得仲春敷茗碗，风来树树落桃花。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27907,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"问园閒坐","author":"范淑","text":"忘此是何地，坐成幽绝境。\n苔纹上石壁，泉响落古井。\n深树绿如屏，朱白渐疏整。\n斜阳日日来，画我园林影。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27908,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"凉夜","author":"范淑","text":"凉夜立前楹，茅檐好风露。\n眉月有沈忧，微光隔幽树。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27909,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"古意","author":"范淑","text":"霜天好明月，感人独凄绝。\n莫怨朔风寒，总是汝衣单。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27910,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"怀直侯兄","author":"范淑","text":"凄风自何来，百感在胸臆。\n人生有生死，骨肉倏离析。\n既已感零落，胡能忘畴昔。\n龆龄共嬉戏，天真自为得。\n未来了不思，既往若未历。\n扑蝶入蒿莱，听蟀觅幽僻。\n聚金拾瓦砾，设食陈梨栗。\n背诵互相夸，迷藏善为匿。\n东园有佳树，相爱若相识。\n赠名引为友，每见必以揖。\n至今犹忆之，怀思动凄恻。\n儿时最爱物，嘱余藏其秘。\n一朝竟失之，君固未我斥。\n转为相慰语，爱割亦吾益。\n我心殊悄悄，追悔每不释。\n当时倚膝下，友爱实靡及。\n历历此寸心，依依如昨日。\n稍长人事乖，嗟痛慈亲失。\n吾家复多难，重以饥驱迫。\n君迹太飘零，君心倍苦挚。\n别君百里遥，怀君若咫尺。\n君书昨日至，君言满金石。\n赠我芝兰枝，贻我古松柏。\n芝兰固自好，何以避霜雪。\n惟兹松柏枝，隆冬好颜色。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27911,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆和城旧舍","author":"范淑","text":"一棹辞归又十霜，梦魂犹忆读书堂。\n推窗遥指一江水，卷幔微闻千树香。\n既往韶光何太促，未来人事觉犹长。\n几回重说儿时事，误道他乡是故乡。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27912,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋晚","author":"范淑","text":"落叶声中下夕阳，草根摇动野风凉。\n黄昏月上不觉晚，薄暮花开何处香。\n一片烟痕山入梦，数声虫语夜生霜。\n徘徊渐识秋深意，又见归飞客燕忙。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27913,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春晓雨后","author":"范淑","text":"片雨过东园，新泥湿未半。\n苔痕青可怜，鸟语多不乱。\n风静柳枝閒，云横山色断。\n饥乌衔实归，哺子松林畔。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27914,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"借斋","author":"范淑","text":"小斋无物足游观，石砚瓷壶一两端。\n听雨恰宜千个竹，钞诗合带一分寒。\n静中生意窗前草，悟后心香案上兰。\n好是匡山排闼入，朝朝把作画图看。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27915,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春晴","author":"范淑","text":"云漾晴光水漾波，閒中得句景中哦。\n读书岁月何常永，啼鸟园林渐觉和。\n人有奇贫尘事少，诗无险体性情多。\n盘桓半亩成幽赏，每送黄昏日影过。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27916,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"怀直侯","author":"范淑","text":"思君不得见，见此夕阳寒。\n生小多奇志，成人有泪弹。\n多情因自爱，万苦博心安。\n悟透沧桑事，人间一别难。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27917,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"月夜","author":"范淑","text":"青山有白云，青天有明月。\n月明天更青，云行山欲活。\n主人好园林，良夜爱清绝。\n临风作遥望，如怀远离别。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27918,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆秋轩葺成和直侯韵","author":"范淑","text":"芦帘纸阁亦何嫌，几费商量夕照天。\n放入花香无隙地，许留明月与千年。\n炉烟入妙通禅悟，幽鸟来依亦有缘。\n参透浮生无限事，别离天又小团圆。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27919,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"病中杂诗","author":"范淑","text":"大风遥起不胜悲，久病先灰各样思。\n只有夙根愁不断，五更清梦醒来时。\n久不窥园蔬菜瘦，又探篱下已残枝。\n近来事事都思了，想到亲恩泪欲垂。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27920,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"作家书寄直侯旋自焚之","author":"范淑","text":"鲁书将发又旋焚，便觉微生细似尘。\n气短自知心力瘁，尚持孤愤寄何人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27921,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春日出游","author":"徐咸安","text":"春风到处绿成阴，浅草平芜缓步寻。\n野外有花皆缀玉，堤边无树不摇金。\n塞鸿数点寥天没，梁燕双飞曲巷深。\n放眼韶光无限好，舞雩归去一长吟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27922,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"月夜放歌","author":"徐咸安","text":"中天明月正团团，秋闺寂寞凭阑干。\n四壁唧唧虫鸣寒，隔墙风弄青琅玕。\n疏林老鸦栖未安，一声惊起空中盘。\n萤火点点如流丸，宵深露重高飞难。\n何人抱琴一再弹，如怨如诉声悲酸。\n停弦不语涕汎澜，馀韵袅袅遏云端。\n秋来自怜腰带宽，闻此益觉摧肺肝。\n银河欲落漏已阑，闭户起剔银缸残。\n倚枕假寐愁漫漫，辗转反侧空长叹。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27923,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"云栖寺","author":"徐咸安","text":"云栖最高处，快意一登临。\n鸟度碧山远，僧行黄叶深。\n修篁团翠色，流水滴清音。\n萧寺偶留憩，佛镫明我心。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27924,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"适园梅花盛开","author":"徐咸安","text":"隔墙消息逗，遥指一枝新。\n索笑来檐际，寻芳过水滨。\n香霏千树雪，花发满园春。\n莫问古梅渡，荒凉愁煞人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27925,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"庭前旧植鸡冠海棠凤仙数本秋日花开欣然赋此","author":"徐咸安","text":"西风庭院一巡行，绀碧丹黄刺眼明。\n映日争看朱帻耀，乞阴会待绿章成。\n化工好事饶秋景，丛艳撩人步晚晴。\n更有凤仙好颜色，秦楼飞去不胜情。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27926,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"郊外閒眺","author":"徐咸安","text":"信步不知远，西风郊外行。\n有秋千户足，无事一身轻。\n沙鸟对人立，溪花沿路生。\n物华玩无尽，归路夕阳明。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27927,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"落叶","author":"徐咸安","text":"西风落叶满庭堆，扫取烹茶日几回。\n万物祇须人利用，竹头木屑亦奇材。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27928,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"晓登五云山","author":"徐咸安","text":"览胜登五云，临发天未晓。\n不辨径高低，祇觉行人少。\n舆行二三里，月尚挂林杪。\n野外唱晨鸡，树边喧宿鸟。\n我怯溪桥危，仆讶山路小。\n盘旋上高峰，曲折如鸟道。\n旭日忽东升，三江烟雾绕。\n早潮一线来，龛赭犹缥缈。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27929,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"适园避暑作","author":"徐咸安","text":"不耐炎炎暑，还依漠漠阴。\n凉飔荷渚近，清响竹林深。\n蚓笛参差奏，鱼鳞隐约沈。\n静观原自得，坐久豁幽襟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27930,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"西湖即事","author":"徐咸安","text":"钱塘门外水清浅，轻舟荡漾随波卷。\n游湖才了又游山，独向巉岩踏苍藓。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27931,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"有约邓尉探海梅遇雨不果","author":"徐咸安","text":"吾闻虎山之崦峰回互，仙境昔有仙尉住。\n面临太湖三万顷，七十二峰似争渡。\n居人家家种梅花，覆压山村不知数。\n风飘十里五里香，雪满千枝万枝树。\n大庾亦无此奇观，足所未历心倾慕。\n倾慕于今几十年，年年花时等閒度。\n今年棹出阖庐城，渴望庶几慰平素。\n闺侣殷殷折柬招，蜻蜓艇子克期赴。\n香海由来传盛名，锦囊满拟贮佳句。\n不道春来日日晴，临行却被天公妒。\n侵晓无端急雨零，弥天但见阴云布。\n扁舟欲行不得行，寂寞空堂绕廊步。\n愁绝小窗欹枕眠，梦魂还绕锦峰路。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27932,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"水阁纳凉偕外子作","author":"徐咸安","text":"杨柳依依里，楼台月正中。\n池光明槛外，萤火度墙东。\n竹粉涵清露，荷香沁晚风。\n此间堪却暑，幽致与君问。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27933,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"初夏即景","author":"徐咸安","text":"漫言春色好，春色不如今。\n红落几番雨，绿添无数阴。\n荷圆初贴水，竹稚未成林。\n触景便成趣，凭栏时一吟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27934,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"学诗","author":"张印","text":"洗心栖沕穆，渊渊鸣天籁。\n缅怀汉班妃，何事日怨艾。\n扇固有时捐，月亦有时晦。\n乃思恩爱重，不共秋风退。\n我诗取怡情，凡百人不逮。\n寒燠听造化，盈亏置度外。\n不淫不伤旨，默与《关雎》会。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":27935,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}}]